# ToolPeak — build-time configuration
#
# Copy to .env for local experiments, but the real values belong in the
# Cloudflare Pages dashboard, NOT in this repository:
#
#   Workers & Pages -> your project -> Settings -> Environment variables
#
# The ad snippets contain your Adsterra account ID. Anyone who can read them
# can point your ad units at their own traffic, so they must never be
# committed. .env is already in .gitignore; keep it that way.


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Site identity  (safe to commit — these are public anyway)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# No trailing slash. Used for canonical URLs, sitemap.xml, RSS and OpenGraph.
SITE_URL=https://toolpeak.com

# Shown on the Contact page and in the Privacy Policy. Must be an address you
# actually read: ad networks email it during review, and people report broken
# tools through it. Cloudflare Email Routing forwards a domain address to a
# normal inbox for free.
CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@toolpeak.com

# Appears in the schema.org Organization block and the copyright line.
PUBLISHER_NAME=ToolPeak


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Adsterra  (secret — set these in Cloudflare only)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Paste each snippet exactly as the Adsterra dashboard gives it to you,
# including the <script> tags. Leaving one blank simply disables that unit,
# which is the right setting until the site is approved.
#
# House rule, deliberately enforced by the build: one popunder, one social
# bar, one in-content banner. There is no way to configure a fourth.

# Popunder — fires once on load, needs no page space.
ADS_POPUNDER=

# Social Bar — the mobile unit.
ADS_SOCIAL_BAR=

# One banner, placed mid-content. 728x90, 468x60 or 320x50.
ADS_BANNER=

# The exact line from Adsterra -> Websites -> ads.txt. Without it the
# publisher cannot be verified and rates drop.
# Example shape (NOT a real ID):
#   ADS_TXT=adsterra.com, 1234567, DIRECT, 1234567890abcdef
ADS_TXT=


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Analytics  (optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Cloudflare Web Analytics token. Privacy-friendly, no cookie, no consent
# banner needed for it — but it is still loaded only after the visitor
# accepts, to keep one clear rule rather than two.
CF_BEACON_TOKEN=


# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Site verification  (optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if you verify by meta tag rather than by DNS record.
# Pinterest verification is worth doing early: claiming the domain puts your
# logo on every pin that links back to it.

GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=
PINTEREST_SITE_VERIFICATION=
